   "source": "Allakhazam quest Face the Twisted (590, Wayback 2004-10-13): \"Vikta's Fancy Pants -- Bard and Ranger, Gaia's Woven Gloves -- Enchanter, Ore Blasted Coif -- Druid and Hero, Stiff and Strong Sleeves -- Nightshade\"",
   "why": "period: Vikta \"rewards you with af 88-90 pants (cloth would be 44-45) that are quite excellent for whatever class you are\"; the reward whispered to Vikta becomes the class version (Bard 48 / Ranger 50 pants, Druid 47 / Hero 44 coif, Nightshade 49 sleeves); classes the period list does not name keep Gaia's Woven Gloves"
  },
  {
   "finding": "P10-D2",
   "kind": "update",
   "table": "DataQuest",
   "set": {
    "StepText": "Find the twisted creatures in the sylvan valley and kill a treecutter.|Kill a barkstripper.|Return the two heads to Vikta in Necht.|Stilter body.|Vine piece.|Sanidon tail.|Ravaging marine shriller voicebox.|Marine shriller voicebox.|Beach shrouder wing.|Beach anglator bone (they come out of the water when sanidons are attacked).|Treant piece.|Talk to Vikta; he gives you a bag. Use it.|Give the bag to Vikta.|Claim your reward: whisper Vikta [Gaia's Woven Gloves]. He gives the reward made for your class: Vikta's Fancy Pants (Bard, Ranger), Ore Blasted Coif (Druid, Hero), Stiff and Strong Sleeves (Nightshade) or Gaia's Woven Gloves."
   },
   "where": {
    "ID": 21439
   },
   "why": "the journal now says which class gets which Face the Twisted reward"
  },
